{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "e8393539c7b49182f1138bbe39f241ea082e6ff47da353d831ecbf1ae88587d6", "ja": "「わかりたい」から", "zh": "因为「想要去理解」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b07078389d71b8f1c45102809f319a61348f036eedffea2f262f226e446baa05", "ja": "初回レッスンから曲を歌いこなしていた麗花\nに近づこうと、志保は麗花の他、静香、茜、\n星梨花にも助言を求める。皆に意見を貰うも\nいまひとつピンとこない志保に、麗花はお互\nいを入れ替えて生活してみようと提案する。", "zh": "志保想要接近从第一次课程起就能唱好歌曲的丽花，于是向丽花以及静香、茜、星梨花寻求建议。虽然得到了大家的意见，志保却还是有些无法领会，于是丽花提议两人互换生活试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "d319859f798f116cf75bfe43db85e62943425a6edc6fdb876c28edd80108bc7b", "ja": "麗花・志保のデュオレッスン後……", "zh": "丽花・志保的双人课程结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "53d95da0e77bab717cac167f2cba7ea12465a1e29ea02bcbbfbb277edacc856c", "ja": "はぁ。麗花さん、すごかったな。\n歌詞に説得力があるっていうか……。", "zh": "唉。丽花小姐真厉害啊。\n该说是歌词很有说服力吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "cca40bbb11262811b1b2ea8e0a49891c21a9943cccc9729a367f13159dab6e06", "ja": "私は、どう歌えばいいんだろう。\n麗花さんに聞いたら、何かわかるのかな。", "zh": "我该怎么唱才好呢？去问问丽花，会不会就明白些什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1003_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "82e015dfe7e94d8e4230b9475ac35b96754d9eeac8bfa1626fb688f4610771bf", "ja": "あ、志保ちゃん！　ケーキはなかったけど、\n冷蔵庫にプリンならあったよ！　一緒に食べない？", "zh": "啊，志保！虽然没有蛋糕，\n不过冰箱里还有布丁哦！要不要一起吃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1005_se", "source_sha256": "632766b1963bbd5d65cd118f29217ec32140023fcf0802dafb4fd7ef14cacead", "ja": "パタパタパタ……", "zh": "啪哒啪哒啪哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "e1994c06a74ede8aaa52e45b8def6c0961453560d9281920e233d5806316ea55", "ja": "麗花ちゃん、手を挙げろっ！　茜ちゃんのプリンが\nそこにあるのはわかってるんだぞ～！？", "zh": "丽花，举起手来！我们知道那里有小茜的布丁～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "6f74c893998376742ba37bb801bfa1b296823380198376958e4f58f739b4b119", "ja": "ええ～！？　これ、茜ちゃんのプリンだったの？", "zh": "诶诶～！？这个原来是小茜的布丁吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "e499ef714330f8ca41ee20c741acbd0009ee77b251a251169dc4e998b438e6fc", "ja": "そうだね！　麗花ちゃんの食べてるプリンは、\nだいたいいつも茜ちゃんのやつだね！？", "zh": "对呀！丽花吃的布丁，基本上一直都是小茜的吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "956a8e3767d2c6d05986b21d7dea7a1b6115fe3b765e8982a507253297716191", "ja": "麗花さん、志保さん、お疲れ様です！\n今日のレッスンはもう終わりですか？", "zh": "丽花姐姐、志保姐姐，辛苦了！今天的课程已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "770fa9f8b99545204bfff7b41e817521cee930be49da22bc23df6716d13448d0", "ja": "ええ、ちょうど終わったところだけど……\nみんな、どうしたの？", "zh": "嗯，刚好结束了……\n你们怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "c79fcf95a24eaa4ab0115942dcd79a6fe502fb882cfa86eab5eed52aa10bf3fa", "ja": "仕事先でたくさんお菓子をもらったの。ちょうど\nいいから、二人に差し入れようって……星梨花が。", "zh": "我在工作地点收到了好多点心。正好合适，就想着给你们俩送点慰问品……是星梨花提议的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "a4d474d30e00eb005613c8cea570cf53895fb00921552ec5cffea389063a5475", "ja": "えっ？　でも、お二人のことは静香さんが……。", "zh": "咦？可是，关于两位的事，是静香姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "2df7ce0bb4a06c478d13b1dc0d83e08529704c3c6def9e0c7ff9de0c1c09cf2c", "ja": "わーいわーい、ありがとう♪　\nじゃあじゃあ、このままみんなでお茶しよっか♪", "zh": "太好啦太好啦，谢谢♪　\n那既然这样，大家就直接一起去喝茶吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "7536a65034c4e564fe66d77672ed90e948f652b9b7ff4dc13bb7d690853425c5", "ja": "もちろん茜ちゃんはそのつもりで来ました！\nでも麗花ちゃん、先にプリンは没収です！　逮捕ー！", "zh": "当然，小茜就是抱着这个打算来的！\n不过丽花，先把布丁没收！逮捕——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "ac53dc57691b785b82d4494372e6409ee751aafbcd3b8f0bbef5425094601443", "ja": "あの、それで、聞いていいかわからないんですけど……\n麗花さんは、恋愛経験があるんですか？", "zh": "那个，我不知道能不能问……丽花姐谈过恋爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "482cec52cb8e71ec07acf486b9e9fc399f50da949bafa2a1342b24e52265f5df", "ja": "突然だね、しほりん！？\nなんだかずっと難しい顔してると思ったら！", "zh": "真突然啊，志保琳！？我还在想你一直皱着眉头呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "786f5bc212cd290d0aec9f860524b2d8a2a5d80338c14710778ca10f77569950", "ja": "あ……。それって、もしかして\n麗花さんと二人で歌う新曲の話？", "zh": "啊……你说的是不是\n要和丽花前辈两个人合唱的新歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "9f31993faa7cb0003e13558879394b726b29207183d85216c0caa94db779cea5", "ja": "そう、レッスンが終わってからずっと考えてて。\nその、言いたくなかったら大丈夫なんですけど。", "zh": "对，课程结束后我一直在想。\n那个，如果你不想说的话，不说也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "c3676dc04991a93c26587ea5be9567f634b4351f554976365aecc9025f541b5d", "ja": "えっとねー、好きな人はいるよ！", "zh": "那个呀——我有喜欢的人哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "8b17765108261e262227e6fb03391ecd6c4b11e512d264bc2e55ff04d3f785db", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか！？", "zh": "咦，真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "c97a497fa689255ed396864f51a41b13b00edc93fd43b933a5e5717c1b17a490", "ja": "うん！　劇場のみんなと～、お父さんお母さん！\nそれに{$P$}さんと～……。", "zh": "嗯！剧场的大家，还有爸爸妈妈！\n以及{$P$}先生，还有……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "f5275bd7b24d05a93a8cff42b153ae0dc2c96481079b6e136a5b39b6806804a3", "ja": "なるほどなるほど～。ちなみに麗花ちゃん、\nさすがにそれは恋愛とは言わないんじゃないかな！", "zh": "原来如此原来如此～顺便说一句，丽花，这应该不能算恋爱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "8f79f532492b6b85d14a4d283d47f73c8888e57c8a08da1bc638dc1c975824ac", "ja": "えー？\nでも私は、みーんな大好きだよ？", "zh": "诶——？\n可是，我最喜欢大家了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "532cc305fe4e479307cde1e2c916cb8d1820a73d24a2323fc49d0ecd05ba0efa", "ja": "私は……恋愛の好きって、なんだかもっと、\n普通の好きとは違うものだと思ってたんですけど。", "zh": "我一直以为，恋爱意义上的喜欢……总觉得和普通的喜欢，更加不同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "6083fd42189c0690534e5f9e8683268a857bd56cc840b70ad18b5350de4fdca6", "ja": "それはそうなんじゃない？　だって好きな人はたくさん\nいてもいいけど、恋人は一人しか作れないんだし……。", "zh": "确实是这样吧？毕竟喜欢的人可以有很多，但恋人只能有一个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "1e4acb5a2ba4eb42e210daf3d31484f1578f97a57f4408ee316a589ab46f43a1", "ja": "モガミン、そうはいっても、世の中には\n恋人が何人もいる人もいるんだゾ☆", "zh": "最上亲，话虽这么说，世上也有人同时交好几个恋人呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "0b63f14529fa606bf103ac2367ebe2666edfa512b795f7f174bd548f34d10318", "ja": "それはダメなやつじゃないですか！", "zh": "那不是糟糕的人吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "6ec38343d01ed88fb1cc01bcb8a1845c90efb349888a1865ee3a9610871863f8", "ja": "恋って、ドキドキするんですよね？　わたしも、\nパパは好きですけど、ドキドキはしないです。", "zh": "恋爱会让人心跳加速，对吧？我也喜欢爸爸，不过不会心跳加速。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "659c3a4d5e4a78e4bd43b0618bc3be59deb3e498b48f9d80c10720019b23f3b1", "ja": "じゃあ、{$P$}さんには？\nドキドキしない？", "zh": "那对{$P$}先生呢？\n不会心动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "439c01381ff5951cd91c26ea480d6bcd5a12674e870fe34a502e0c480d64d21a", "ja": "{$P$}さんですか？\nそれはえっと……あれ？", "zh": "对{$P$}先生吗？\n那个，呃……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "830dcf1597d8499f976e21883b78ba94337821eb18900d7016044068a72c0131", "ja": "こ、恋じゃなくてもドキドキはするんじゃない！？\n恋は……まねっこじゃわからない、もっと特別な……！", "zh": "就、就算不是恋爱，也会心跳加速的吧！？\n恋爱……不是靠模仿就能明白的，是更加特别的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "1bd96051804f4552283661db9465438c64faaf5cb0d05078804193604f70d6bf", "ja": "特別かぁ。でも誰かを好きになるって、\nとっても普通のことじゃないかな？", "zh": "特别啊。不过喜欢上某个人，\n不是很普通的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "b3c19b3151c4051d54ba4b303b0b8b415516ab7bae278f49d33fa85d3f2493c6", "ja": "特別だけど普通、なんですか？\nうーん……。むずかしいです。", "zh": "虽然特别，但也很普通吗？\n嗯……好难理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "94832c33a907f6f43539ae727bf5397d1da8acdf4eca88c8ec130e540f421916", "ja": "でも、麗花さんは多分わかってるんですよね。\n新曲も一回でものにして……すごいです。", "zh": "不过，丽花姐大概已经明白了吧。\n新歌也一次就掌握了……真厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "d40b34597b8203b154f84dfd45a68266116b84fc3903bf9cea384e15e1288076", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとう。でも私は志保ちゃんのほうが、\nいろいろすごいと思ってるんだよ？", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢。不过我觉得志保才更厉害呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "c754be782ae5c6c9f2993b2b08527526c53540e12079281f523382255abf5231", "ja": "え？　……どうしてですか？", "zh": "诶？……为什么这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "bb1b0050476868dd2cbf64d7381f8e88651ce5b1a1f5737f23bf792d7a73cd42", "ja": "アイドルの仕事も一生懸命だし～、よく弟さんのお迎え\nにも行ってるでしょ？　それにお母さんのお手伝いも！", "zh": "你在偶像工作上也一直很努力～还经常去接弟弟，\n也会帮妈妈做事，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1039_033sih", "source_sha256": "86521b517c17cc169d88779c594b00cf99836fc23d286fdf4427f14cbfc76115", "ja": "それは……別に、普通のことだと思いますけど。", "zh": "那……我觉得这没什么，只是很普通的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "3030eff4fbcde43720d35864ce8d25a3f0ebc6aeef177f76712b724260b87535", "ja": "うん。だからすごいと思うんだ！\n私には難しいんじゃないかなぁ。", "zh": "嗯。所以才觉得很厉害啊！\n感觉对我来说挺难的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1041_033sih", "source_sha256": "d92dc740954e8a129412961a86ddaf96cd4273b34c68fbc487ca0550fca57701", "ja": "えっと、でもそれは歌には何も関係ないような……。", "zh": "那个，不过这和唱歌好像没什么关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1042_048rei", "source_sha256": "8dc8e9a748ee925e2d9eaf861dbffe769f7c7bdb4034c2ca7ea5222d422afb3f", "ja": "そうだ！　志保ちゃん、私と入れ替わってみない？", "zh": "对了！志保，要不要和我交换一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1044_023aka", "source_sha256": "2674033d62f5f59d9f9e3b1c6cbb2d9f9434948ea41baabb688df0c2a4b44bf8", "ja": "うーん、\nいつもながら話が急展開だね、麗花ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯——真不愧是你，事情发展得真突然啊，丽花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1045_022ser", "source_sha256": "b841e89a98b05fc9e9220e08201bb583d7ee315e44f8ac97b2d162989fe97751", "ja": "入れ替わるって、\n麗花さんが志保さんになるってことですか？", "zh": "所谓交换，是指丽花小姐变成志保小姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1046_048rei", "source_sha256": "610726b8fb02547eeb46c1d267b1cfd817fc80b5130af40e6b6c0bb9f2af7467", "ja": "そう！　そうすれば、私にわかることが、\n志保ちゃんにもわかるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "没错！这样一来，我所了解的事情，志保应该也能明白了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1047_048rei", "source_sha256": "29977a05eadf5920e64b2616bc52085e26d2b722f09153ef5da7e9274acaaec7", "ja": "私も志保ちゃんのこと、もっとわかりたいなーって\n思ってたの。ね、やってみない？", "zh": "我也一直想着，要是能再多了解志保一点就好了呢——来试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1048_033sih", "source_sha256": "c91d3ecb382941b3d0aa8f2eb3be457d1c1155099787b181993831736e0d83d4", "ja": "麗花さんにわかることが……。", "zh": "丽花小姐能理解的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1049_015siz", "source_sha256": "d56127ceee609e0c9e4875316789c542add1117609088311432862812bbac1d8", "ja": "でも、入れ替わるなんて……。\nできませんよね？", "zh": "可是，要互换什么的……\n做不到吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1050_033sih", "source_sha256": "c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95", "ja": "わかりました。", "zh": "好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1051_015siz", "source_sha256": "e58d6c89b25ad60ac32d61245ef328371ee767e0e85793f3bce5d3be539b2204", "ja": "えっ、できるの！？", "zh": "诶，能做到吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1052_033sih", "source_sha256": "7a9e0f11183d0ab296351368521f4a1ee89363317d14fc0bef703e271da02044", "ja": "それは、わからないけど……。\n麗花さんはきっと、わかってると思う。いろいろと。", "zh": "这个……我也不知道……  \n但我觉得，丽花姐一定都明白。各方面都是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_02_1053_033sih", "source_sha256": "daa466ec09323aad4d3bbd5599c0dcc081979a2155e040034f7faee0fa6d16f5", "ja": "デュオなのに、私がいつまでも足を引っ張るわけには\nいきませんから。だから……やってみます。", "zh": "明明是双人组合，我不能一直拖后腿。所以……我会试试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
